  "purpose": "route B v7 keeps the single-arbiter planner exactly as v6 declared it and adds one bounded recovery for a lost hero marker. When the marker stays unknown past the declared trigger, the Router stops waiting and retreats along the reversed, quantized last-known displacement, region-checked against the last known position and capped by maximum_recovery_steps, so a transient detection loss no longer turns into a self-sustaining stop. The localization-gap guard still ends the episode CAPTURE_FAILURE/localization_gap, so a failed recovery is never a silent success.",
